cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis code, please cite the published study."
title: "Depression awareness and self-perception among Syrian university students: analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible R pipeline for a cross-sectional survey of 967 medicine, dentistry
  and pharmacy students in Syria, measuring depressive symptoms with the Arabic
  Zung Self-Rating Depression Scale and knowledge of depression with a 17-item
  awareness score. Generates every published table and figure from the raw survey
  export.
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "[Elsharkawy]"
    given-names: "[Muhammad M. ]"
    affiliation: "Faculty of Medicine, Alexandria University, Egypt"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3804-315X"
keywords:
  - depression
  - Zung Self-Rating Depression Scale
  - mental health literacy
  - medical students
  - Syria
  - reproducible research
